WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060
MusicTag / Early hardware concept — Choose music on the phone, then operate the tactile remote. Browser simulation.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.479
Play and pause — The large centre button controls the same track on the phone.

00:00:08.479 --> 00:00:13.742
Skip without browsing — Next and Previous update the phone’s title, artwork and playback status.

00:00:13.742 --> 00:00:18.107
Adjust volume — Volume changes the synthesised preview level as well as the visible percentage.

00:00:18.107 --> 00:00:30.573
Choose a different playlist on the phone — MusicTag controls playback; playlist selection stays on the phone.

00:00:30.573 --> 00:00:32.075
MusicTag / End of early concept walkthrough — Recorded interactions with the repository’s early-concept prototype, not physical device footage.
